      "content": "it doesnt feel like a medical symptom though... its more like my brain is picking up on something. like i saw this thick red cloud in the corner of my eye right before a guy in a truck lost control of his steering and hit a pole. it wasnt like a flash, it was like a density or a texture. i've been trying to map it out. do you think it's possible that the particle exposure actually altered my perception of quantum probability? like, instead of just seeing light, im seeing the actual likelihood of events manifesting?",
